#. module: bf_email_systray
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_email_systray.field_res_config_settings__bf_email_systray_mode
msgid ""
"**In a panel**: the inbox opens over the current screen, which stays in place. You read an email and go back to what you were doing without losing your place.\n"
"\n"
"**Full page**: the button opens the inbox like the menu does, replacing the current screen.\n"
"\n"
"This is the database default. Everyone can change it from the button's menu, and their choice prevails."
msgstr ""

